    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i've read online that since it's just an herb it shouldn't be that bad compared to synthetic drugs. i'm pretty careful with my pill anyway so i doubt a little supplement would change much. do you really think it's a big deal? like is there actually a proven risk or is it just a precaution?",
